      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOM GUMP (5) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and two placings from six starts. Recorded a nose win (16.94) in a Maiden last time at this track. Looks a leading chance on best. DYNAMIC BANJO (4) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when third (19.92) at this track. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Winning chance. RAYMONDI (2) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish second, beaten 1.5 lengths, (17.02) at this track. Has good speed and a low draw is a big help. Expected to feature again. SUGAR RIOT (1) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
